{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21788","headline":"有鸟二十章 二 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟毛似鹤，行步虽迟性灵恶。\n主人但见闲慢容，许占蓬莱最高阁。\n弱羽长忧俊鹘拳，疽肠暗着鵷雏啄。\n千年不死伴灵龟，枭心鹤貌何人觉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}